# SigurnaDob API — local development

@SigurnaDob.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7210

### Anonymous
GET {{SigurnaDob.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Login — admin (no profile)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{SigurnaDob.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@sigurna-dob.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Login — coordinator
# @name loginCoordinator
POST {{SigurnaDob.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "coordinator@sigurna-dob.local",
  "password": "Coordinator123!"
}

### Current user (requires token)
GET {{SigurnaDob.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
